w Roman" w:hAnsi="Times New Roman"/><w:sz w:val="28"/></w:rPr><w:t>A production-ready MVP patient portal typically requires 12 to 16 weeks, encompassing wireframing, compliance architecture, electronic health record integration, security penetration testing, and regulatory documentation.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:sectPr w:rsidR="00FC693F" w:rsidRPr="0006063C" w:rsidSect="00034616"><w:pgSz w:w="12240" w:h="15840"/><w:pgMar w:top="1440" w:right="1440" w:bottom="1440" w:left="1440" w:header="720" w:footer="720" w:gutter="0"/><w:cols w:space="720"/><w:docGrid w:linePitch="360"/></w:sectPr></w:body></w:document>